The package boost-graph-parallel is compatible with built-in CMake targets of FindBoost.cmake:

    find_package(Boost REQUIRED COMPONENTS graph_parallel)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Boost::graph_parallel)

or the generated cmake configs via:

    find_package(boost_graph_parallel REQUIRED CONFIG)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE Boost::graph_parallel)
